    {
      "q": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The ratio of ages of A and B, 4 years ago was 7 : 10 and the ratio of their ages after 6 years will be 4 : 5. What is the present age of B?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>4 वर्ष पूर्व, A और B की आयु का अनुपात 7 : 10 था तथा 6 वर्ष बाद उनकी आयु का अनुपात 4 : 5 होगा, तो B की वर्तमान आयु कितनी है?</p></span>",
      "o": [
        "<span class=\"eqt\">20 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">20 वर्ष</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">22 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">22 वर्ष</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">24 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">24 वर्ष</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">26 years</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">26 वर्ष</span>"
      ],
      "a": 2,
      "s": "<p>Let the age of A and B 4 years ago is 7x and 10x respectively</p><p>According to question,</p><p>(7x + 10)/(10x + 10) = 4/5</p><p>35x + 50 = 40x + 40</p><p>5x = 10</p><p>x = 2</p><p>Age of B = 10 * 2 + 4 = 24 years</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "<style> @font-face { font-family: 'Cambria Math'; src: url('https://appx-content-v2.classx.co.in/fonts/cambriamath.ttf') format('truetype');} @font-face { font-family: 'Nirmala UI'; src: url('https://appx-content-v2.classx.co.in/fonts/Nirmala.ttf') format('truetype');} </style><style> img, svg {vertical-align: middle; max-width:100%; } *{overflow-wrap: break-word;}  </style> <span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> Find total numbers between 1 and 635 which are neither divisible by 3 nor by 7.</span><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt\"><span style=\"font-family:'Nirmala UI'\">1 और 635 के बीच कुल संख्या ज्ञात करें जो कि न तो 3 से विभाज्य हैं और न ही 7 से।</span></p>",
      "o": [
        "<style> @font-face { font-family: 'Cambria Math'; src: url('https://appx-content-v2.classx.co.in/fonts/cambriamath.ttf') format('truetype');} </style><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> 364 </span><span style=\"width:34.38pt;display:inline-block;font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> </span>",
        "<style> @font-face { font-family: 'Cambria Math'; src: url('https://appx-content-v2.classx.co.in/fonts/cambriamath.ttf') format('truetype');} </style><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> 365 </span><span style=\"width:33.73pt;display:inline-block;font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> </span>",
        "<style> @font-face { font-family: 'Cambria Math'; src: url('https://appx-content-v2.classx.co.in/fonts/cambriamath.ttf') format('truetype');} </style><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> 362 </span><span style=\"width:34.9pt;display:inline-block;font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> </span>",
        "<style> @font-face { font-family: 'Cambria Math'; src: url('https://appx-content-v2.classx.co.in/fonts/cambriamath.ttf') format('truetype');} </style><span style=\"font-family:'Cambria Math'\"> 363</span>"
      ],
      "a": 2,
