    {
      "q": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">The sum of the two numbers is 98. The differ</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">ence between the two numbers is 28, Find one of the two numbers.</span></p>",
      "o": [
        "<p>32</p>",
        "<p>62</p>",
        "<p>58</p>",
        "<p>35</p>"
      ],
      "a": 3,
      "s": "<p>6.(d)</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">Let the numbers are a and b , then </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">According to the question , </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">a + b = 98 and </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">a -</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> b = 28 </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">on adding both the equations , we get </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">2a = 98 + 28  </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">a = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>126</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">= 63</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">Second number (b) = 98 - </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">63 = 35 </span></p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "<p>13<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">.</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> Let x </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">be the greatest number of 4-digits which when divided by 12</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">,15,16</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> and 20, the remainders are 9, 12, 13, and 17, respectively. The sum of the digits of </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> is;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">SSC GD 2021 07/12/2021 (Afternoon) </span></p>",
      "o": [
        "<p>13</p>",
        "<p>27</p>",
        "<p>17</p>",
        "<p>28</p>"
      ],
      "a": 1,
      "s": "<p>13<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">.(b)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">The remai</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">nder in each case = 3 i.e. = 12-9 = 15-12 = 16-13 = 20-17</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">LCM of (12</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">,15,16</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> and 20) = 240</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">When, the greatest 4-digit no </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">i</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">,e</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">, 9999 is divided by 240 gives 159 as remainder</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">So, the required no (x</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">)=</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> (9999 - 159) - 3 = 9840 - 3 = 9837</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">Therefore, the sum of di</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">git (x) = 9 + 8 + 3 + 7 = 27</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The number 4, 29, 714 is divisible by:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">संख्या 4, 29, 714 किससे विभाज्य है:</span>",
      "o": [
        "<span class=\"eqt\">3 and 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3 और 5</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">6 and 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6 और 5</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">4 and 6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4 और 6</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">3 and 6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3 और 6</span>"
      ],
      "a": 3,
      "s": "<p>This cannot be divided by 5 as unit digit is not 5 or 0</p><p>So option (a) and (b) got eliminated</p><p>Last two numbers 14 is neither zeros nor divisible by 4 therefore option (c) also got eliminated.</p><p>For a number divisible by 3, sum of its digits should be divisible by 3</p><p>Sum of digits = 4 + 2 + 9 + 7 + 1 + 4 = 27 (divisible by 6)</p><p>A number is divisible by 6 if it is divisible by both 2 and 3.</p><p>Number is divisible by 2 as last digit is even number.</p><p>Option (d) satisfies.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If the four-digit number 535y is divisible by 7, then what is the value of y?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>यदि चार अंकों की संख्या 535y, 7 से विभाज्य है, तो y का मान क्या है?</p></span>",
      "o": [
        "<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"
      ],
      "a": 1,
      "s": "<p>If a number is divisible by 7, then the last digit of the number multiplied by 2 and subtracted from the rest of the number, leaving the last digit, will be 0 or a multiple of 7.</p><p>Now check the options,</p><p>Option a: y = 4, so 535  -  8 = 527 not a multiple of 7.</p><p>Option b: y = 5, so 535  -  10 = 525 a multiple of 7.</p><p>So, y = 5</p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "<p>10<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">How many prime numbers exist between 50 and 80?</span></p>",
      "o": [
        "<p>5<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span></p>",
        "<p>7<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span></p>",
        "<p>8<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span></p>",
        "<p>6</p>"
      ],
      "a": 1,
      "s": "<p>10<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">.(b) </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">Prime number between 50 to 80 = </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">(53 , 59 , 61 , 67 , 71 , 73 , 79) = 7</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "q": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>When the integer A is divided by,18 the quotient is X and the remainder is 7. When the integer A is divided by 25, the quotient is Y and the remainder is 10. Which of the following is true?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>जब पूर्णांक A को ,18 से विभाजित किया जाता है तो भागफल X होता है और शेष 7 होता है। जब पूर्णांक A को 25 से विभाजित किया जाता है तो भागफल Y होता है और शेष 10 होता है। निम्न में से कौन सा सत्य है?</p></span>",
      "o": [
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x + 25y = 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x + 25y = 2</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x - 11y = 3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x - 11y = 3</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x - 25y = 3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x - 25y = 3</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x + 11y = 1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x + 11y = 1</span>"
      ],
      "a": 2,
      "s": "<p>According to the question,</p><p>A = 18x + 7</p><p>and A = 25y + 10</p><p>So,</p><p>18x + 7 = 25y + 10</p><p>18x - 25y = 3</p>"
    }
