/span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">होता</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">है।</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> x </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">के</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अंकों</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">का</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">योग</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">क्या</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">है</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> ?</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">SSC GD 2021 07/12/2021 (Afternoon) </span></p>",
