      "a": 1,
      "s_hi": "<p>13<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">.(b)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">प्रत्येक</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">स्थिति</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">में</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">शेष</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> = 3 </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अर्थात</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> = 12-9 = 15-12 = 16-13 = 20-17</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">( 20, 15, 16,<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">और 20</span> ) का</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">ल</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">स</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> = 240</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">जब</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">, 4 </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अंकों</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">की</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">सबसे</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">बड़ी</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">संख्या</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> 9999 </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">को</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> 240 </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">से</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">विभाजित</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">करने</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">पर</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> 159 </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">शेषफल</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">मिलता</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">है</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अतः</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अभीष्ट</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">संख्या</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> (x)= (9999 - 159) - 3 = 9840 - 3 = 9837</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अत</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अंकों</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">का</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">योग</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> (x) = 9 + 8 + 3 + 7 = 27</span></p>"
