    {
      "q_hi": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The number 4, 29, 714 is divisible by:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">संख्या 4, 29, 714 किससे विभाज्य है:</span>",
      "o_hi": [
        "<span class=\"eqt\">3 and 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3 और 5</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">6 and 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6 और 5</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">4 and 6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4 और 6</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">3 and 6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3 और 6</span>"
      ],
      "a": 3,
      "s_hi": "<p>This cannot be divided by 5 as unit digit is not 5 or 0</p><p>So option (a) and (b) got eliminated</p><p>Last two numbers 14 is neither zeros nor divisible by 4 therefore option (c) also got eliminated.</p><p>For a number divisible by 3, sum of its digits should be divisible by 3</p><p>Sum of digits = 4 + 2 + 9 + 7 + 1 + 4 = 27 (divisible by 6)</p><p>A number is divisible by 6 if it is divisible by both 2 and 3.</p><p>Number is divisible by 2 as last digit is even number.</p><p>Option (d) satisfies.</p>"
    },
    {
      "q_hi": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If the four-digit number 535y is divisible by 7, then what is the value of y?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>यदि चार अंकों की संख्या 535y, 7 से विभाज्य है, तो y का मान क्या है?</p></span>",
      "o_hi": [
        "<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>"
      ],
      "a": 1,
      "s_hi": "<p>If a number is divisible by 7, then the last digit of the number multiplied by 2 and subtracted from the rest of the number, leaving the last digit, will be 0 or a multiple of 7.</p><p>Now check the options,</p><p>Option a: y = 4, so 535  -  8 = 527 not a multiple of 7.</p><p>Option b: y = 5, so 535  -  10 = 525 a multiple of 7.</p><p>So, y = 5</p>"
    },
    {
      "q_hi": "<p>10<span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">50 </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">और</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> 80 </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">के</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">बीच</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">कितनी</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">अभाज्य</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">संख्याएँ</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">मौजूद</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: Nirmala UI;\">हैं</span><span style=\"font-family: Cambria Math;\">?</span></p>",
