    {
      "q_hi": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>When the integer A is divided by,18 the quotient is X and the remainder is 7. When the integer A is divided by 25, the quotient is Y and the remainder is 10. Which of the following is true?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>जब पूर्णांक A को ,18 से विभाजित किया जाता है तो भागफल X होता है और शेष 7 होता है। जब पूर्णांक A को 25 से विभाजित किया जाता है तो भागफल Y होता है और शेष 10 होता है। निम्न में से कौन सा सत्य है?</p></span>",
      "o_hi": [
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x + 25y = 2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x + 25y = 2</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x - 11y = 3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x - 11y = 3</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x - 25y = 3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x - 25y = 3</span>",
        "<span class=\"eqt\">18x + 11y = 1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18x + 11y = 1</span>"
      ],
      "a": 2,
      "s_hi": "<p>According to the question,</p><p>A = 18x + 7</p><p>and A = 25y + 10</p><p>So,</p><p>18x + 7 = 25y + 10</p><p>18x - 25y = 3</p>"
